<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#hasSex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "NIBRS sex code for a victim or offender." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#victimInIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a victim to the incident in which it appears." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#hasVictimType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a victim to a NIBRS victim type." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#OffenseType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A NIBRS offense category such as murder, robbery, or aggravated assault." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#Offender> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An offender associated with an incident." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#offenderInIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an offender to the incident in which it appears." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#hasRelationshipType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a victim-offender relationship record to a NIBRS relationship type." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#relatedToOffender> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Shortcut relation linking a victim directly to an offender. The detailed relationship type is represented through VictimOffenderRelationship." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#hasIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an offense to the incident in which it appears." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#Victim> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A victim associated with an incident and possibly with one or more offenses. In NIBRS, victims may be individuals, organizations, society/public, or other non-person entities." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#hasOffenseType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an offense to its offense type." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#hasOffender> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a victim-offender relationship record to its offender." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#VictimOffenderRelationship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A relationship record connecting a victim, an offender, and a NIBRS relationship type." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#hasAge> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Age in years, if available and valid." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#hasVictim> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a victim-offender relationship record to its victim." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#RelationshipType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A NIBRS relationship category describing how a victim is related to an offender." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#involvedInOffense> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a victim to an offense in which the victim was involved." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#offenseCode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The NIBRS offense code, for example 09A, 120, or 13A." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#VictimType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A NIBRS victim type, such as individual, business, government, or society." .
<http://example.org/nibrs/ontology#crimeAgainst> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Descriptive NIBRS crime-against category, if available." .
